.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_mi_port_sdformat" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_mi_port_sdformat \- 2-Wire Port Specific Data - Supported Data Format (SDFORMAT)
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_mi_port_sdformat {
.br
.BI "    NVME_MI_PORT_SDFORMAT_BYTE_LEVEL"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVME_MI_PORT_SDFORMAT_512B"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVME_MI_PORT_SDFORMAT_4KIB"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_MI_PORT_SDFORMAT_BYTE_LEVEL" 12
Byte Level data format of the
NVMe-MI Persistent Data Area is
supported
.IP "NVME_MI_PORT_SDFORMAT_512B" 12
512B data format of the NVMe-MI
Persistent Data Area is supported
.IP "NVME_MI_PORT_SDFORMAT_4KIB" 12
4KiB data format of the NVMe-MI
Persistent Data Area is supported
